      "role": "user",
      "content": "It sounds like the \"consensus\" is basically just the more progressive view though. If a lot of experts are still arguing about it, can we really call one side the \"consensus\" and the other just an \"argument\"? Is it fair to say the biological view is being dismissed as incorrect rather than being treated as a valid scientific perspective?",
